      "required": null,
      "appliesTo": null,
      "minCoverage": null,
      "text": "No official source we could read states a travel-insurance requirement for Samoa. The UK Foreign Office says that in a medical emergency evacuation to Australia, New Zealand or Hawaii is likely to be the only option for treatment, and advises adequate travel health insurance and accessible funds.",
      "source": {
        "url": "https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/samoa/health",
